        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Oil Rubbed Bronze Kian 36 Inch Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 36 Inch Kian Oil Rubbed Bronze Door Pull is an excellent choice for any modern space. It can be mounted on interior or exterior doors in both commercial and residential settings. The Oil Rubbed Bronze Kian 36 Inch Door Handle is available in thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, and back to back mounting on doors up to 3 inches thick. The Oil Rubbed Bronze Rectangular Pull has 36 inch mounting centers and measures 36-3/4 inches in total length. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNeed a different size?  <a href=\"/products/24-inch-kian-oil-rubbed-bronze-door-pull\"><b>24 Kian Inch Door Pull</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/48-inch-kian-oil-rubbed-bronze-door-pull\"><b>48\" Kian Inch Door Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/60-inch-kian-oil-rubbed-bronze-door-pull\"><b>60\" Kian Inch Door Pull</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/72-inch-kian-oil-rubbed-bronze-door-pull\"><b>72\" Kian Inch Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Rectangular Doorware Designs RTMPULL36-613:\r\n<ul>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Grade Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Oil Rubbed Bronze</b></li> \r\n<li>Total Length: 36-3/4\" (934mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 36\" (9140mm) C/C</li>\r\n<li>Grip Width: 1-1/2\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 3\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Can be installed on fiberglass, wood, glass, and metal doors.\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-RTMPULL36-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262424\"><b>DWD-RTMPULL36 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
